message: >-
  Cite this repository as the source-code archive accompanying the manuscript.
  The attribution below identifies the publishing GitHub account; the
  confirmed manuscript author list belongs to the paper itself. No journal
  DOI is asserted here.
type: software
title: >-
  Six-Dimension Complete Coding Agent for Chinese Clinical Free Text to OMOP
  Standard Concepts
authors:
  - name: raywong2121
repository-code: https://github.com/raywong2121/agentsforEHR
url: https://github.com/raywong2121/agentsforEHR
abstract: >-
  Source code for coding Chinese clinical free text into OMOP standard
  concepts as six-attribute records (concept, assertion/time, value, specimen,
  subject, anatomic site). Pipeline: model extraction, dual-path vocabulary
  retrieval (ICD10CN Maps-to bridge + English name/synonym search), bounded
  reformulation, selection or explicit abstention, self-verification with one
  correction cycle, deterministic checks, and strategy-level memory with human
  approval gates. Evaluation data and results are not distributed here.
keywords:
  - OHDSI
  - OMOP CDM
  - clinical natural language processing
  - concept mapping
  - Chinese clinical text
  - agentic coding
